## Ground rules for edits
- Keep ORM queries typed — no raw SQL unless strictly necessary.
- Money amounts: watch the unit (centavos vs reais) per vendor. See `.claude/skills/`.
- Never commit `.env`. Add vars to `.env.example` when you introduce new ones.
- pt-BR first when user-facing copy is involved.

## Skill index
Each integrated vendor has a skill file in `.claude/skills/<vendor>/SKILL.md`
with auth model, base URLs, core endpoints, webhook signing, and a working
TypeScript snippet. Read those before wiring a new feature — do not guess.

